 indescribable (so is the profound sadness when you find out that item is actually frost relic).", "timestamp_created": 1560614859, "timestamp_updated": 1560614859, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "51241142", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072271076", "personaname": "B A N S H E E", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/l4d3confirmed/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 51349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3616, "last_played": 1787112233, "avatar": "9a95b7df14d9a9c366d503969a0428fa777e1f30"}, "language": "english", "review": "flew into outer space from going too fast, stole my friend's drops, had a run that lasted way past my bedtime, and it ruined 3 relationships. 10/10 would get cancer from a wisp again", "timestamp_created": 1560614685, "timestamp_updated": 1560614685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51239527", "author": {"steamid": "76561198215723529", "personaname": "Atied", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/420666789/", "num_games_owned": 164, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1871, "last_played": 1764899653, "avatar": "d7cec07f4b5db63cc82a6ff3374a4f5f503dee3c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game", "timestamp_cre